POV: você ficou milionário aos 23 — EP 1
Everything in the picture is drawn in code; score, foley and ambience are synthesized in code (mix.py).

Voice
- VoiceStudio / OmniVoice (k2-fsa/OmniVoice model, Apache-2.0; VoiceStudio app code AGPL-3.0), run locally on CPU.
  Narrator / "você": the series voice (designed "male, young adult", voicestudio/ref_voice.wav), cloned per line.
  Caio: designed with OmniVoice voice design ("male, young adult, high pitch"), voicestudio/ref_caio.wav, cloned per line.
- Speech check: faster-whisper "small" (MIT).

Fonts (Google Fonts, SIL Open Font License 1.1)
- Baloo 2 (Ek Type), VT323 (Peter Hull), Bungee (David Jonathan Ross)

Engine
- toon.js vector engine adapted from the Sci-Fi Sitcom Toon style of the library (see LICENSE of the library).
